# Sporogenic Infection ({1}{B}: Mox Jet, Mox Ruby) enchants Bot2's Memnite and its enters trigger targets Bot2, who also has an
# Ornithopter and a Phyrexian Walker: the enchanted Memnite is not a choice, so Bot2 sacrifices the Walker (its choice) and keeps the
# Memnite and the Ornithopter. Bot1's own Memnite is untouched (the player targeted, not Bot1, sacrifices).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sporogenic Infection
Memnite
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Phyrexian Walker
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sporogenic Infection.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Phyrexian Walker)

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Memnite; Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard = Phyrexian Walker
Bot1.Battlefield = Memnite; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Sporogenic Infection
Stack.Count = 0
